{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24048","headline":"感白莲花 · 白居易","name":"感白莲花","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白白芙蓉花，本生吴江濆。\n不与红者杂，色类自区分。\n谁移尔至此，姑苏白使君。\n初来苦顦顇，久乃芳氛氲。\n月月叶换叶，年年根生根。\n陈根与故叶，销化成泥尘。\n化者日已远，来者日复新。\n一爲池中物，永别江南春。\n忽想西凉州，中有天宝民。\n埋殁汉父祖，孳生胡子孙。\n已忘乡土恋，岂念君亲恩。\n生人尚复尔，草木何足云。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24048.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24048","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}